{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/867354-trinity-universe-or-trinity-universe-d20","id":867354,"title":"Trinity Universe, or Trinity Universe D20","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-17T21:19:01-07:00","id":867354,"title":"Trinity Universe, or Trinity Universe D20","content":"Alright, I'm looking at the DriveThruRPG. There are two sections for Trinity Universe. One is listed as Trinity Universe, the other is Trinity Universe D20. Which of these is the new one?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'll be your Huckleberry","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2397-the-dude","name":"The Dude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T21:44:48-07:00","id":867368,"title":"","content":"Neither, Trinity D20 converted the ST system to open license. Trinity Universe is the original game line.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/293-lncbill","name":"lncbill","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T22:40:25-07:00","id":867380,"title":"","content":"The original setting (unnamed while it was active, but retroactively called the Trinity Universe) was published from 1997 to about 2002.<br /> <br /> In 2004, White Wolf tried to bring the setting back by converting it to the d20 system, which is when &quot;Trinity Universe&quot; first started being used. To date, the setting is the only one which used what were at the time the two most popular RPG systems: d20 and Storyteller.<br /> <br /> The new edition -- the <i>Trinity Continuum</i> -- is still in development, and thus there's nothing available for it yet beyond a poster and a few shirts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-18T17:11:16-07:00","id":867929,"title":"","content":"Oh okay, now I'm pretty glad of that since I was under the impression that D20 was what Onyx Path was working on, and it made me a sad panda because attempting to read Abberant D20 I was like &quot;Well now....this is a giant ball of suck&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'll be your Huckleberry","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2397-the-dude","name":"The Dude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-20T06:51:54-07:00","id":869282,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Dude</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/867354-trinity-universe-or-trinity-universe-d20?p=867929#post867929\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh okay, now I'm pretty glad of that since I was under the impression that D20 was what Onyx Path was working on, and it made me a sad panda because attempting to read Abberant D20 I was like &quot;Well now....this is a giant ball of suck&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> If you want to know more about the Trinity Continuum as it develops check out the Monday Meeting notes and recent teasers - and you can check out a compilation Google Document of what we know so far - hit the link in my sig to visit the G+ community for the TC, more details on that page.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#ff0000\"><b>Ad Astra</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/232-chill","name":"CHILL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar232_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-20T15:53:08-07:00","id":869724,"title":"","content":"Haha......no. Those Monday Meeting Notes confuse me when I actually know the product. Of all of the Trinity Products I only know Aberrant so it's only confuse me even more","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'll be your Huckleberry","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2397-the-dude","name":"The Dude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-21T14:46:58-07:00","id":870658,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Dude</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/867354-trinity-universe-or-trinity-universe-d20?p=869724#post869724\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Haha......no. Those Monday Meeting Notes confuse me when I actually know the product. Of all of the Trinity Products I only know Aberrant so it's only confuse me even more</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Fair enough - try the 'what we know' doc I mentioned, that may be a little easier to skim <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#ff0000\"><b>Ad Astra</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/232-chill","name":"CHILL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar232_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-29T07:23:56-07:00","id":902700,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Dude</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/867354-trinity-universe-or-trinity-universe-d20?p=867929#post867929\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh okay, now I'm pretty glad of that since I was under the impression that D20 was what Onyx Path was working on, and it made me a sad panda because attempting to read Abberant D20 I was like &quot;Well now....this is a giant ball of suck&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Adventure! ports over surprisingly well, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4042-chessvice","name":"ChessVice","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}